@page "/components/native-select"

<PageTitle>Native Select — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Native Select</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The same element as <a href="/components/select">Select</a>, dressed as shadcn's newer
    native-select recipe. Both are a real <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>; this one keeps the browser's
    own control and only frames it.
</p>

