<h2 class="doc-h2">Native Select vs Select</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The difference is which arrow you get, and nothing else: neither needs JavaScript, both post
    the same way, and both bring the OS picker on a phone. In upstream shadcn the two are far
    apart — one is a real element, the other is a listbox of divs with a hidden input behind it —
    and here they are the same element twice.
</p>
